#. A raid's first step, at the camp.
msgid "raids.camp.arrive.steps.0.text"
msgstr "Find the tracks"

#. A raid's second step, at the camp.
msgid "raids.camp.arrive.steps.1.text"
msgstr "Count {1} footprints"

#. The quiet raid's only step.
msgid "raids.quiet.arrive.steps.0.text"
msgstr "Wait"

#. What Ada says when the camp is raided, first.
msgid "raids.camp.said.0"
msgstr "They came in the night."

#. What Ada says when the camp is raided, second.
msgid "raids.camp.said.1"
msgstr "Check the box."

#. The day on the HUD. {1} = the day number
msgid "hud.day"
msgstr "Day {1}"
